{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/151048-ic-wyoming-in-the-dusk-hunter-mortal-game","id":151048,"title":"IC - Wyoming In the Dusk [Hunter/Mortal Game]","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play","Play by Post"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-05-27T22:59:52-07:00","id":151048,"title":"IC - Wyoming In the Dusk [Hunter/Mortal Game]","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b><u><span style=\"font-size:20px\">WoD: WYOMING IN THE DUSK</span></u></b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>A Mortal/Hunter the Vigil Game with GMC Rules</b></span></div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Wyoming. One of the least populated states of the Union, almost perfectly square in shape, and troubled with an alarmingly high suicide rate. Not much happens in this flyover state, perched between mid-America and the former Old West; neither monster nor mortal has any special interest in it. Despite what might be the case in other states, the archaeological sites out here do not have much in the ways of artifacts or ley lines, and the small population means that victims (or potential food) are not as common. On the radar of the major hunter groups, there's little reason to have a strong presence out there, though organizations like the Union may rally around the cities. With so little to offer, it's not much of a place for many to flock to....<br /> <br /> But this is the World of Darkness. Everything is true, nothing is impossible, and there's always a chance someone has a reason to kill you.<br /> <br /> <b>OOC Thread: </b></span></span>http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/151040-ooc-wyoming-in-the-dusk-hunter-mortal-game<br /> <b>Dice Roller (link to your roll):</b> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/</a><br /> <br /> <b>The Cast:</b><br /> <br /> <i>Brian Devereux</i><br /> Age: 33<br /> Organization: Lucifuge<br /> Player: BridgeWarden<br /> Appearance: <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"http://i1292.photobucket.com/albums/b571/potatouprising23/WoD/th_Brian_zps33da4bdd.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Born in France, family came to live in Northern Virginia around 1985. Discovered his infernal heritage in college, resulting in his first accidental summoning. Luckily the agents of the Lucifuge found him before too much damage could be done. He traveled to Milan briefly, before being shipped off to Wyoming for Lady Lucifuge-only-knows-why. Perhaps it's a punishment for his naive convictions about using dark powers for good. Perhaps it's because of some dire need his conspiracy has for him to go there. Perhaps Bigfoot. Regardless, he was shipped home and is driving up to Wyoming with a trunk full of arcane goodies for <span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">summoning </span>banishing infernal beasts and the like.<br /> <br /> __________________________________________________ __________________________________________________ _<br /> <br /> <br /> <i>Vincent Mortain</i><br /> Age: Early middle age (?)<br /> Organization: Ashwood Abbey<br /> Player: proindrakenzol<br /> Appearance: <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Height: 5'8&quot;<br /> Weight: 140lbs<br /> Hair: Dirty Blond<br /> Eyes: Brown<br /> Appearance: Handsome and Fit</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Vincent Mortain is a semi-Professional archer and a trust fund kid. He graduated Harvard with gentleman's Cs with a degree in Humanities. After graduation he spent his time traveling the world hunting big game and exotic entertainment (preferably female and humanoid, but, eh). He recently came to the attention of the Ashwood Abbey at a high-society soiree, word of his interests and skill having made its way to them. Vincent is interested in what thrills the Abbey can bring him.<br /> <br /> He is in Wyoming due to rumors of creatures to hunt, while there he will procure the most lavish accommodations possible - preferably with a multi-car garage and stables.<br /> <br /> <br /> __________________________________________________ __________________________________________________ __<br /> <br /> <br /> <i>Eulalia Bonner</i><br /> Age: 42<br /> Organization: None<br /> Player: crapcarp<br /> Appearance: N/A<br /> <br /> Eulalia had studied psychology in the city, but went straight back to her hometown when she was done as she tired of the city-life(her hometown is basically wherever this chronicle starts, as I never lived in Wyoming). Since then, she has held a small psychology clinic that she runs by herself and has a stable, though small, clientele. She employs a unique technique for her patients, in that she lucid dreams about them after her sessions with them, gaining invaluable insight from her sub-conscious. This allows her to dig deep into her patient's psych and solve problems that would take most psychologists and psychiatrists far longer to do, and even ones that they would miss. She has a poly-phasic sleep pattern in which she sleeps for 20 minutes every 4 hours to do this. She has mastered lucid dreaming to such a fine degree that she gained clairvoyance through it, allowing her to gain even more insight by seeing into the lives of her patients. Despite her small notoriety in her town and specialist circles, she still has a small clientele. Because of this, there may be times where she doesn't get quite enough to sustain her lifestyle, as humble as it is, and has been pushed to make small and sparse shoplifts from time to time.<br /> <br /> She is very courteous and polite at all times, even when others are being extremely rude to her. It takes quite a lot to make her snap at someone. Having such an intimate knowledge of the human mind she can manipulate practically anyone to do her bidding through simple conversation. However, she knows that she could easily abuse her abilities and become corrupted, so she keeps herself humble to prevent this from happening. Due to her many years of psychology, she has learned all the darker aspects of humanity, giving her a pessimistic worldview. She is fully aware of the greater aspects, but she genuinely feels that oftentimes the worst of people is brought out more than their best.<br /> <br /> __________________________________________________ __________________________________________________ __<br /> <br /> <br /> <i>Piero J. Abelli</i><br /> Age: 25<br /> Organization: None<br /> Player: ocel<br /> Appearance: <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> He kind of looks like that character from Dishonored, tall, lanky, thin, wearing thick glasses, baggy eye lids, casual clothes, when not working, likes jeans and khakis, cotton shirts and such.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Piero J. Abelli was born on April 15th, 1989, in Albany, New York. His mother, Emily Miller, grew up in Wyoming, Michigan, where her father, William, worked, refining oil into gasoline, kerosene and other goods. William's wife, Jillian, was a stenographer for one of the city's courthouses. The Millers moved to South Orange, New Jersey on 1968, September 8th, reaping the fruits of their labors. Emily enrolled in Seton Hall University a year later, she met a young man there named Daniele Abelli. They married on 1979, November 12th, in the university's chapel, shortly after graduating. -- His parents encouraged him to pursue an academic career at an early age. He became a paramedic on 2012, May 5th, for one of the hospitals there. The place was robbed a year later; he was there that day, hiding in a closet, overhearing them shout to the personnel, demanding to load stores of blood onto their truck. Afterwards, he was sent to witness protection, in a remote corner of Wyoming...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":1874,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","user":"Sikla Alkis","date":". 05-28-2014, 02:31 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-27T23:30:29-07:00","id":151060,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><u>WEEK ONE</u></b></span><br /> </div> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Brian Devereux:</b><br /> <br /> Your Monday starts like something out of a bad comedy movie. After leaving a motel that was in the middle of nowhere (and frankly, the kind of thing you'd find in <i>Psycho \u2014 </i>the shower had odd, brown stains on the bottom), you found yourself swerving off the road to avoid a lost cow. Yes, that's right: a <i>cow,</i> followed by its ever-so-helpful herd that ended up running around the road for an hour. You were forced to stay in your car thanks to an angry bull, which left a dent and a broken headlight before the farmer (and some highway patrolmen) managed to round up the mooing horde. A tow truck was called, and one of the patrolmen was nice enough to pay to get you towed to a little hamlet about ten miles north. Your cabin will be not far from there, and it has a small store where you can pick up supplies as needed. You are currently riding shotgun with a burly, middle-aged man with a farmer's tan, sporting a handlebar mustache and thinning, greying black hair. He's said barely a word to you as he's driven, and the smell of barn permeates the truck as country classics twang from the radio.<br /> <br /> Traffic whizzes by, coming and going as it usually does. You don't have a lot of options for entertainment; you could always <b>look at where you are, strike up a conversation, or try to change the station.</b> Then again, it's up to you on how you kill time.</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <div align=\"right\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Vincent Mortain:</b><br /> <br /> Unlike Brian, your current ride is far more luxurious and accommodating. You are in a limousine behind Brian's tow truck, and Brian's driver refuses to let yours pass. Champagne and glasses sit perched in a custom cupholder; a small TV, fitted above the window to the front, is blaring some program or another. You can hear the driver cussing angrily beneath his breath, but as of now, you are unsure why the limousine is wavering back and forth. Your father would probably have a fit if he saw how your current chauffeur is acting, but he's not here \u2014 or in America, for that matter. To make up for missing your last birthday, he's given you a paid vacation to some sort of hunting lodge in the middle of Wyoming, and while that's happening, he's over in Europe for some sort of business affair.<br /> <br /> The driver cusses again, this time a bit more loudly. You could <b>look around, ask him what's going on, or see what's on television right now. </b>But you're the king here, rich boy \u2014 what do YOU want to do?</span><br /> </div> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Eulalia Bonner:</b><br /> <br /> You don't usually make house calls, but today is an exception. You're driving all the way from Laramie, Wyoming to a hamlet in the middle of the plains; a frantic call for help has come from a single mother living on a farm. She is at the end of her rope, her daughter nearly catatonic \u2014 from the frantic chatter that came over the phone, you heard that the girl was threatening to commit suicide. She's fourteen years old, and for the past six months, has been on a wild downward spiral after witnessing her father hang himself in the family barn. The girl's been in-and-out of a psychiatric care facility since then, but the family's bills are racking up, and the farm is threatening to go into foreclosure. You're not sure how this woman got your number, but she mentioned a patient of yours having given her your contact info.<br /> <br /> Unfortunately, with time being of the essence, it doesn't help that there's a fish-tailing limousine driver in front of you. Every time you try to pass him, he gets in front of you, and it looks like there's a car in front of him that doesn't want to pass as well. Your cell phone has rung four times already, and now it's ringing a fifth time. You could <b>look around, try to get in front of the limousine driver, or answer your phone somehow,</b> but it's up to you. There's a million things you could be doing, and right now, your mind's addled on what to do first.</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <div align=\"right\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Piero Abelli:</b><br /> <br /> You're on your way from Laramie as well, though you're not as hurried as the woman driving in front of you. Unlike Eulalia, there is no urgency to your cause, but you might be feeling unnerved anyways. One of the blood bank thieves has been spotted at the Wyoming border; he was driving a stolen car with Michigan plates, and gunned down a patrolman before driving off. Nobody knows if he went into Wyoming or not, but Witness Protection has told you to be careful, and that you're going to have to move your safehouse. There's a tiny hamlet to the north that's an ideal hiding place; it has low traffic, most of the people there are related to the local patrolmen, and it's far enough from any urban center that few people have a reason to go out to it. You are tuned in to a Wyoming news station, which is currently chattering on about the shooting caused by the thief.<br /> <br /> Music switches on, the radio announcer putting on some sort of song about big rigs and their rig jockeys. You could <b>look around, fiddle with the radio, or think over your plans for your new house. </b>There's a million things you can think of, thankfully, to get your mind off the fact that someone who wants you dead might be close to your bolt-hole.</span></div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-28T05:08:25-07:00","id":151208,"title":"","content":"Brian's eyebrows knit into a scowl as he looked out the window at the passing terrain. Boring, flat, redundant terrain. He still didn't know why the emissaries from Milan had shipped him out here, but some small part of him was starting to wonder if it wasn't simply to keep him away from even the remotest possibility of occult happenings. Even the legions of hell wouldn't be interested in a place like this.<br /> <br /> Perhaps that was for the best though- considering most of his occult supplies were still in the trunk of the dilapidated <a href=\"http://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2d/05-07_Subaru_Outback_wagon.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">Subaru</a>. He was certain some of the jars had broken when he'd had to swerve to miss the herd of confused bovine on the way here, and it wasn't likely he'd be able to replace a lot of what he'd brought in the Podunk little town they were driving to. Glancing back towards his car in the mirror, he saw that a line was starting to form up behind the driver. Deciding that a direct collision with his trunk was sure to shatter <i>even more</i> of the assorted esoteric supplies he'd brought along, Brian glances over at the driver, doing his best not to let the annoyance show on his face or carry into his voice.<br /> <br /> &quot;Maybe we should give these folks a chance to get by... that moron driving the limo looks like he'd be more than happy to slam into the rear end of my car, and I'd hate for you to have to wait while I take down his insurance information.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">A monster by any other name...</span></i>","edited":{"userid":1204,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1204-bridgewarden","user":"BridgeWarden","date":". 05-28-2014, 08:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1204-bridgewarden","name":"BridgeWarden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1204_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-28T15:17:36-07:00","id":151763,"title":"","content":"(Vincent is 28 years old)<br /> <br /> <br /> Vincent looks up from his book (<i>Wytchcraft Around the World</i>, picked up on a lark due to the silly 'y') in annoyance at the sudden weaving; he takes a deep breath before keying the intercom.<br /> <br /> &quot;Are you <i>trying</i> to make me nauseated, or are you just incompetent? Just straighten out and drive.&quot;<br /> <br /> Vincent releases the com button and looks over at his bow and chuckles darkly. &quot;Wouldn't be much sport but it might be amusing.&quot;<br /> <br /> Taking a sip of his champagne he looks up at the show playing on the TV. If it's anything other than news or business he changes it to a news channel.<br /> <br /> Picking his book back up he flips to the chapter on mystics and psychics.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-28T16:59:02-07:00","id":151827,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://www.myth-weavers.com/sheetview.php?sheetid=914469\" target=\"_blank\">Character Sheet</a> (updated the link to the Mythweavers sheet)<br /> <br /> Eulalia puffed out yet another annoyed sigh as the phone blared on. Answering it was out of the question. She may have been in a hurry, but getting into an accident would delay her far longer than this traffic. She didn't want to try getting ahead of the limousine again, as it was fruitless at this point, and trying harder might get her into an accident. She would just have to wait it out.<br /> <br /> &quot;Why is there so much traffic here all of a sudden?&quot; she wondered. This wasn't a particularly busy road, and there was a limousine in front of her. Why would a limousine of all things be driving through these plains? She also noticed the cause of it's swerving, a tow truck that wouldn't let it pass. The phone's ringing really started to drill into her ears, especially considering it was probably from the mother and she couldn't answer it.<br /> <br /> Unable to do much of anything else, she decided to at least comfort herself by turning on the radio to drown out the ringing and the fact that she would arrive to her destination eventually.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2992,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","user":"crapcarp","date":". 06-02-2014, 08:11 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T16:49:11-07:00","id":153238,"title":"","content":"Piero checked the rear-view mirror of his car to see if there was anyone tailing him. He read the inscription on it, <i>objects in (the) mirror are closer than they appear,</i> and looked over his shoulder to confirm that. He saw, from this vantage point, that it wasn't a typo.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","name":"ocel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T19:33:12-07:00","id":153400,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"right\"><b>Brian Devereux:</b><br /> <br /> The driver's stony gaze flickers over to you, his lip sourly quirking. His mustache droops a little on one side, a gruff General American accent going, &quot;Yeah, and the little bitch wouldn't let me pass ten minutes before I pulled up to you. It's called 'payback', son.&quot; He makes an unpleasant sound of approval, his statement having been tinged with pride, and he proceeds to crank up the radio. Though the limousine driver cannot hear the country tunes played, it seems to be a further tool of defiance, starkly contrasting something more fitting for LA or New York than the open road.</div> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":1874,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","user":"Sikla Alkis","date":". 06-03-2014, 04:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-31T06:53:28-07:00","id":154784,"title":"","content":"((Guess I'll go ahead and post my character's response since that part is finished...))<br /> <br /> Brian arches a brow, but finally just turns and resumes looking out the window. No need to start making enemies in town if it could be helped at all. Crossing his arms, he waits for their eventual arrival in town, engaging the driver in brief dialogue if he says anything but otherwise keeping silent. Closing his eyes, he tries to relax his mind and meditate somehow, in spite of the irritating music blasting out through the speakers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">A monster by any other name...</span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1204-bridgewarden","name":"BridgeWarden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1204_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-03T13:14:31-07:00","id":158187,"title":"","content":"<b>Vincent Mortain:</b><br /> <br /> &quot;I apologize, sir, but someone in front of us will not let us pass,&quot; said the driver, curt yet polite in his tone. &quot;I do hope the young master isn't too nauseated. I shall 'straighten out', as you said, though we may arrive at our destination later than expected.&quot;<br /> <br /> There's nothing interesting on the next closest news channel, CNN. Stories about a couple of shootings and some random celebrity events are airing, but nothing too terribly important to the hunter cause. Commercials flick by like the endless Wyoming landscape \u2014 a new toothpaste, a brand of hair gel, another morbid-but-cheerful antidepressant commercial, a local psychic hotline....<br /> <br /> <div align=\"right\"><b>Eulalia Bonner:</b><br /> <br /> As the radio drones on, your phone rings again, and again, and again. Nothing can cease the unrelenting barrage of calls, and it appears you'll have to pick up sooner or later. At least your ring tone is catchy; the <i>beep-beep-boops </i>are not nearly as grating as some of the ringtones of old. In fact, they seem almost soothing, hypnotic to the tune of your heartbeat, the whirr of the wheels below you....<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;North....&quot;</i><br /> <br /> It's just a whisper, but it filters through between notes of music and the buzzing of your phone. In fact, it might even escape your notice. <b>(Roll Perception using the linked dice roller to hear it)</b><br /> <br /> <br /> </div> <b>Piero Abelli:</b><br /> <br /> As you look over, you see a bright red sports car pulling up behind you, already uncomfortably close. It's clearly not local, flashing NJ plates; the driver is a tanned, bleach-blond twentysomething that looks straight from <i>Jersey Shore. </i>He is riding incredibly, uncomfortably close on your bumper, and appears to be half-driving, half air-guitaring to something on his radio.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-03T16:53:55-07:00","id":158411,"title":"","content":"Irritated by the driver Vincent snorts an affirmative and leans back. Vincent writes down the psychic hotline number thinking about investigating for legitimate witchcraft later.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-03T17:14:36-07:00","id":158436,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4523621/\" target=\"_blank\">Perception Roll(6 dice)</a>((Exceptional success FTW, w00t!))<br /> <br /> &quot;That's odd,&quot; Eulalia thought as the whispers caught her ear. She turned off the radio to listen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-04T16:22:48-07:00","id":159438,"title":"","content":"&quot;Damn it,&quot; Piero grumbled. He turned back to the windshield, searching for an exit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":729,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","user":"ocel","date":". 06-05-2014, 12:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","name":"ocel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-04T19:31:26-07:00","id":159649,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Everyone:</b></div> <div align=\"center\">You catch it between the roll of your wheels, the jarring cry of your phone and the blast of music, Eulalia. You only hear it when all three play: <i>&quot;North, north, north....&quot; </i>It's a whisper from somebody, androgynous and faint; there is no one else in the car with you. The sound undulates, steady like a heartbeat, dribbling like liquid mercury.</div> <div align=\"center\"><br /> The rest of you hear something fuzzy, poking at the edge of your hearing like a thorny shrub into your side. The sound is not as clear to you as it is to Eulalia, nor can you tell what it is. In fact, you might even brush it off, if you so choose. <b>(Roll Perception if you want to hear it, using the linked dice roller)</b></div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-05T12:12:42-07:00","id":160131,"title":"","content":"Vincent cocks his head, thinking there might be something in the background noise. 1 success: <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4525727/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4525727/</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-05T13:03:46-07:00","id":160175,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>proindrakenzol</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/151048-ic-wyoming-in-the-dusk-hunter-mortal-game?p=160131#post160131\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Vincent cocks his head, thinking there might be something in the background noise. 1 success: <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4525727/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4525727/</a></div> </div> </div> </div>((Just a friendly note about the dice roller, you can use a code so that it automatically counts successes. Just put in xd10.hitsopen(8,10). The code counts all the rolls of 8 or greater as successes, and rerolls all the 10s it gets. You can take a look at my roll for an example.))","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-05T17:04:30-07:00","id":160379,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">Piero ignored the music that was playing in the background. <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4525926/\" target=\"_blank\">(OCC: Here are the results of my roll.)</a></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":729,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","user":"ocel","date":". 06-05-2014, 09:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","name":"ocel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-11T18:27:05-07:00","id":166420,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Everyone:</b><br /> <br /> The strange chant \u2014 a hiss to Vincent, a mantra-esque repetition to Eulalia \u2014 abruptly cuts itself off as the truck in front slows and takes an exit. Directly ahead, traffic suddenly grinds to a halt; a small line of cars is beeping ahead. Five vehicles down, the road is smeared with oil, metal and a reddish slick, the remains of six cars mashed and jumbled together. There is no bright red of a fire truck visible, nor are there sirens from either an ambulance or police; the accident appears to have just happened. The rough shape of an arm juts out a few meters ahead, caught under the front-most vehicle that has slowed.<br /> <br /> And, as people begin to emerge from their cars to see the disaster, a young woman is staggering towards your cars, players. She has dusty brown hair, and she is <i>splattered </i>with blood and gore. Her walk is drunken, and one arm is at a crooked angle \u2014 she doesn't seem to be all there. Drifting towards the side of the road, no one seems to notice her as drivers run towards the carnage.<br /> <br /> <b>(Roll whatever you think is appropriate)</b></div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-11T23:17:12-07:00","id":166665,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://www.myth-weavers.com/sheetview.php?sheetid=914469\" target=\"_blank\">Character Sheet</a><br /> <br /> &quot;Great, as if the limo and truck weren't bad enough,&quot; Eulalia sighs in her mind. At least she could answer the phone now. As she does, she notices the woman at the side of the road. She plans to try and help the woman after the call. But for now, she simply tries to see her emotional state.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4532783/\" target=\"_blank\">(Wits + Empathy + Specialty = 8 dice; 9-again quality from Professional Training)</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-11T23:18:57-07:00","id":166667,"title":"","content":"Vincent tells the driver to stop, opens the sunroof, strings his bow, knocks an arrow and draws a bead on the woman's heart (aim action).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-13T06:41:00-07:00","id":167833,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">Piero steps out of his car, carrying an iPhone in one hand and a first aid kit in the other. Dialing 9-1-1, as his fellow commuters survey the wreckage, he notices that there's a woman nearby, who, judging from her injuries, is a survivor of this catastrophe. He stuffs the smartphone into his right pant pocket, then runs to that girl, and shouts, &quot;hey!&quot;</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":729,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","user":"ocel","date":". 06-14-2014, 08:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","name":"ocel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-16T08:49:49-07:00","id":170785,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Everyone:</b><br /> <br /> From what you can tell, Eulalia, the girl is in a state of deep emotional shock. It's enough that she doesn't notice her broken arm, or the oozing cuts on her arms and legs that are draining her of precious lifeblood. She looks ready to collapse, but some sort of vague goal \u2014 probably survival, or finding help for another \u2014 is keeping her upright. The girl is not registering the severity of the situation, nor is she paying attention to anyone.<br /> <br /> That is, until Piero yells at her. She looks over at him with a haunted look, and there is a brief flash of utter despair. She sinks to her knees and begins to weep, uncontrollably sobbing and gagging as she spits out more blood. There is a gurgling, grinding noise, and a ragged pang to every breath she takes. When she looks up again, she freezes, locking rabbit-like eyes with Piero's. She does not say a word, but continues to hiccup and sniffle. The phone, meanwhile, drops the call Eulalia answers \u2014 a quick look at the caller ID shows it's the mother of the troubled girl.</div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":1874,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","user":"Sikla Alkis","date":". 06-17-2014, 02:47 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-16T20:46:01-07:00","id":171350,"title":"","content":"((Who's calling? Eulalia answered the phone))","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-16T23:46:35-07:00","id":171465,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>crapcarp</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/151048-ic-wyoming-in-the-dusk-hunter-mortal-game?p=171350#post171350\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">((Who's calling? Eulalia answered the phone))</div> </div> </div> </div>((Fixed. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ))","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T01:04:25-07:00","id":172532,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">Piero kneels before this girl, looks at her in the eye, and says... &quot;Fear not, for I am here to help you.&quot; </span><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">\u200bHe then tends to her broken arm. </span><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">&quot;How's the other one; can you move it?&quot;</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":729,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","user":"ocel","date":". 06-18-2014, 05:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","name":"ocel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T18:27:15-07:00","id":173438,"title":"","content":"((Thank you))<br /> <br /> &quot;What was the point of that?&quot; Eulalia thought, annoyed at the sudden drop of the call. Her patient would have to wait for now though, and there was more urgent business to attend to. She gets out of the car to try and calm the woman down.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4540095/\" target=\"_blank\">(Manipulation + Empathy + Specialty + 9-again)</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-21T06:59:58-07:00","id":175971,"title":"","content":"Vincent continues aiming, but scans for any other potential threats.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-25T18:44:57-07:00","id":180257,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Everyone:</b><br /> <br /> The girl weakly tries to move her other arm, and succeeds in doing so. She starts crying again, but her inconsolable state is slightly lessened thanks to Eulalia, who appears like an angel out of nowhere. Between choking sobs, the girl tries to speak, gasping and trying to calm herself as well. The cry of sirens is distant, but oncoming, and others are trying to help people out of the carnage that is up ahead.<br /> <br /> &quot;There was...&quot; she weakly begins, hiccuping and swaying in her place. &quot;There was...a dog on the road...we tried to go around it....&quot; She shudders as if cold. &quot;I...I remember being on the road.... When I got up.... The car was behind me.... I think...I think I was thrown out....&quot;</div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-25T18:58:26-07:00","id":180264,"title":"","content":"If Vincent is close enough to easily hear this he shifts his focus towards where the dog would have been. Otherwise no change.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-25T22:26:14-07:00","id":180448,"title":"","content":"As Eulalia listens to the woman, she starts looking around to see if anyone else needs help. As she does, she notices Vincent with his bow, and it looks like he's aiming straight for her face. She instantly jumps up and yelps at the sight.<br /> <br /> &quot;What are you doing?!&quot; she cries at Vincent.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-26T09:55:08-07:00","id":180951,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">Piero takes some medicine out of his first aid kit. &quot;Alright. I'll have that treated as well. Just...&quot; Eulalia, the newcomer, cuts him off before he can finish that last sentence. Curious, he turns around to see what she's yelling at. It isn't long before he notices something off in the distance, wielding what appears to be a bow and arrow. He turns back to his patient and screams... </span><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">&quot;Get down!&quot;</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":729,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","user":"ocel","date":". 06-26-2014, 03:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","name":"ocel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-26T19:27:03-07:00","id":181541,"title":"","content":"Vincent notices the two noticing him, with a click of his tongue he turns the bow towards the general direction of the crash (stops aiming), but keeps his arrow knocked.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-29T13:30:32-07:00","id":183998,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Everyone:</b><br /> <br /> The girl screams and flops to the ground, wailing in terror and unsure of what's going on. She is not lucid enough to focus on Vincent, and uses her good arm to pull herself against Piero, curling into his chest. Sobs wrack her body, and she shivers like a baby in the cold against the paramedic. Her cries are enough to call people's attention, others starting to run over to where she lies.<br /> <br /> As you stare at Vincent, Eulalia, you begin to feel a little niggling behind your ear. It's a cold set of pinpricks, like the skin has gone numb; you might be tempted to turn your head. Only you hear the words whispered, hissed into your ear: <i>&quot;North of Laramie.... North of Laramie....&quot; </i>For the briefest second, there is a blurry flash out of the corner of your eye, the steel of cars smudged together with road's stone.<br /> <br /> But as soon as you notice it, it is gone, and there is nothing but the accident scene. A police car pulls up, and officers start marching towards the crowd around the girl. A man in a suit is with them.</div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-29T22:09:37-07:00","id":184539,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://www.myth-weavers.com/sheetview.php?sheetid=914469\" target=\"_blank\">Character Sheet</a><br /> <br /> Eulalia immediately brushes off the weird experiences as she notices the police's arrival. &quot;Officer,&quot; she shouts as she points to Vincent, &quot;There's a man pointing a weapon at us!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-01T15:43:02-07:00","id":185820,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">Piero tries to loosen this girl's grip on him. </span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":729,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","user":"ocel","date":". 07-10-2014, 02:56 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","name":"ocel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-03T17:54:57-07:00","id":187546,"title":"","content":"((Since apparently it's &quot;my turn&quot; despite having nothing to react to.))<br /> <br /> Vincent does nothing different because the cop hasn't approached him yet and there's nothing for him to do except keep scanning because nothing has happened for him to react to.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-03T21:51:26-07:00","id":187715,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>proindrakenzol</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/151048-ic-wyoming-in-the-dusk-hunter-mortal-game?p=187546#post187546\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">((Since apparently it's &quot;my turn&quot; despite having nothing to react to.))</div> </div> </div> </div>((Well, I'm sure he'd react to Eulalia tattle-tailing him. I mean, wouldn't he try to go back in the car or something? Or at least withdrawing his bow, as he probably wouldn't bet the cop knows anything about the supernatural. Just a few ideas))","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-03T22:01:37-07:00","id":187721,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>crapcarp</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/151048-ic-wyoming-in-the-dusk-hunter-mortal-game?p=187715#post187715\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> ((Well, I'm sure he'd react to Eulalia tattle-tailing him. I mean, wouldn't he try to go back in the car or something? Or at least withdrawing his bow, as he probably wouldn't bet the cop knows anything about the supernatural. Just a few ideas))</div> </div> </div> </div>((He hasn't noticed the cop, he's scanning the area of the accident and half paying attention to the wounded woman. And there's nothing supernatural about the bow.))","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T19:06:10-07:00","id":192998,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Everyone:</b><br /> <br /> The officers turn their heads towards Vincent, a couple already moving towards him with guns drawn. They waste no time in moving towards your car, Vincent; there's a bit of wiggle room between you and the rest of the traffic behind you, and the lane over seems to still have traffic moving through it (albeit slowly). Enough chaos is in the air that you could <b>try to lose yourself in the crowd</b>, or you could give up. You could also try and see if the <b>driver can flee</b>, but ultimately the next move is up to you.<br /> <br /> Piero, your attempts to move the girl off of you are in vain. She clings like a frightened cat, nails digging in so deeply they leave marks on your arms. You cannot help but notice that her body is growing cold, the heat of her body draining as blood does all over your clothes. Despite breaking down, she is not collapsing into shock, though it appears she might be close to at some point.<br /> <br /> Eulalia, a couple of officers stay with you and keep you back, guns drawn and pointed at where you said the bowman was. Piero's a couple of feet from you now, and you can't help but notice something...off. The girl clinging to him is still bleeding, but it's something about the colour. <b>(Roll Wits+Composure to look)</b></div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T20:36:55-07:00","id":193067,"title":"","content":"Vincent lowers the bow and feigns surprise and startlement. He grins sheepishly down at the approaching officers and says: &quot;Sorry, gentlemen, just got back from safari, my wits and reflexes haven't quite adjusted to being Stateside again, yet.&quot;<br /> <br /> He places the bow in the vehicle, but keeps it ready at hand in case it's needed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T21:32:12-07:00","id":193115,"title":"","content":"&quot;Oh sure you were,&quot; Eulalia thought as she glared at Vincent. The police were taking care of him, so she didn't have to worry about that anymore. However, one worry traded in for another as she looked towards the wounded woman clutching Piero. How was she still alive? Eulalia was no medical expert, but she knew that the woman must've lost far too much blood to survive, or at least too much to have any energy to move like that anymore.<br /> <br /> Speaking of the blood, she noticed something very odd about it...<a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4565294/\" target=\"_blank\">((Perception - 6 dice))</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-10T11:03:07-07:00","id":193795,"title":"","content":"Seeing that the man with thebow is being handled by the officers, the man in the suit approaches and you get a better look at him he wears a black suit with a white shirt and a black tie, his black hair are short and well groomed, the typical image of a government agent, boring and at the same time a bit intimidating at least he's not wearing sunglasses.<br /> <br /> &quot; Ladies and gentlemen may I have you're attention please, I am agent Talahan, I'm here to ask you a few questions about this incident this could be a matter of national security so I require your full cooperation.&quot;<br /> <br /> He pulls out an ID that identifies him as a federal agent but not much more although it looks genuine you have never seen this type before.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-11T16:07:32-07:00","id":195092,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">Piero turns to one of the police officers and shouts... &quot;This girl needs medical attention! Stat!&quot;</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":729,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","user":"ocel","date":". 07-11-2014, 08:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","name":"ocel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-13T07:23:59-07:00","id":196265,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Everyone:</b><br /> <br /> The police officers don't look impressed, Vincent. In fact, they don't even look convinced. Too coolly and civilly for all things considered, one of them snaps, &quot;Get out of the car, sir!&quot; and motions with his gun, his partner's eyes flickering around. It's not really a show of force...it's more like they want to keep things quiet, all of a sudden. Another man is looking warily over at Piero and the girl.<br /> <br /> And with good reason \u2014 like you, Eulalia, he seems to notice that the girl's blood is <i>becoming translucent. </i>It's like her body is filled with red dye, and the dye is finishing flushing out of her system. Piero wouldn't notice it unless he really looked, but you...for some reason, you and the officer can see it clearly. In the back of your mind, you hear and <i>feel </i>a sudden burst of static, scratching at your inner tissues like cat claws against rough boards.<br /> <br /> Meanwhile, the men with Magnusar don't seem to notice you, Piero. They flicker their eyes towards you, but they are behaving...oddly. They don't seem concerned, looking at the girl like she's feigning injury. The girl's sobs have quieted, and now, she is <i>glaring </i>at the men. Your wet shirt suddenly feels cold.<br /> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-14T13:45:35-07:00","id":197144,"title":"","content":"Concern rose within Eulalia as she continued to experience the situation she was in. The line of cars before, the sudden drop of the mother's call, the chant she keeps hearing, the man pointing an arrow at her, the woman continuing to bleed, the blood becoming translucent, the burst of static she felt, and now the odd behavior of everyone(expect Piero), especially the woman. Everything was building up to something, but what exactly was it?<br /> <br /> She had a feeling that the woman was up to something, and used her skills in psychology to see past those glaring eyes. <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4570871/\" target=\"_blank\">(Wits + Empathy = 7 dice + 9-again)</a><br /> <br /> &quot;What is going on here?&quot; she asks Talahan.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-17T02:15:59-07:00","id":199844,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><i>Something's wrong. Why aren't they -- what the!</i> Piero's eyes widen in horror as the blood on his clothes turns translucent.<br /> (OCC: <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4568931/\" target=\"_blank\">Here are the results of my perception check.</a>)</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":729,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","user":"ocel","date":". 07-17-2014, 06:55 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","name":"ocel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-17T14:57:25-07:00","id":200423,"title":"","content":"Vincent ducks back into the limo and grabs his bow, ensuring the string is taught and his arrows are read. He keys the intercom: &quot;Keep the engine running and be ready to <i>drive</i>.&quot;<br /> <br /> He opens the door, slowly, and steps partially out, trying to keep as much door between him and the officer as possible, as well as keeping his bow hidden.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-20T15:50:25-07:00","id":203287,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> -{OoC: Posting because Magnusar hasn't posted.}- </div> </div> </div><b>Piero:</b><br /> <br /> An icy cold pierces through your skin where the blood is making contact. Something shoots up your veins, your muscles, your nerves \u2014 it is absolutely piercing, maddeningly chilly. Your head swims for a minute, the colours in your vision greying as the girl's voice hisses in your head.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Don't make a move. Don't even make a sound. You're going to listen to <b>me </b>now, and I'll be damned if I'm dragged back into the Pit without taking you with me, so don't even try it.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> <b>(Roll Resolve+Composure to resist, Piero!)</b><br /> <div align=\"right\"><b>Eulalia:</b><br /> <br /> Something here is very, very wrong. You hear chattering whispers all around you, warning you of threats and serpents and stranger things. You barely make out the voices before you are gone again, but you definitely hear the threat the woman makes...even though her lips <i>are not moving</i>. She stares daggers at Piero, gripping her fingers into his skin like a cat into a prey animal's. You feel a tugging at the inside of your brain, and just a hint of fog as the woman's voice echoes through yours, but it's more like the sound is being played back. There is some sort of attachment to it, like an umbilical cord from an unseen womb.<br /> <br /> <b>(Roll Composure+Occult to focus on the sound; it feels like it's &quot;attached&quot; to something, so you can use this roll to try and probe it)</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><br /> </div> <b>Vincent:</b><br /> <br /> The cops swarm the car like ants. Your driver is grabbed, tackled and cuffed, yelping as his shoulders are nearly dislocated with the force. The officers are hopping the car now, trying to get to you as on-lookers yell and start backing away in panic. Stop cars screech to a halt as people run across the road, and in this chaos, <b>there are many chances to escape</b>. It's up to you if you take them, however; you could always <b>confront the officers</b>. Feel <b>free to do your own thing</b>, as well.<br /> <br /> <b>(Roll Dex+Stealth if you want to hide)</b><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-20T17:11:24-07:00","id":203312,"title":"","content":"Vincent grabs his bow and arrows and ducks into the crowd attempting to hide. (<a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4578404/\" target=\"_blank\">6d10.hitsopen(8,10)=1</a>)<br /> <br /> He also tries to keep an eye on what's going on with the &quot;injured&quot; woman.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-20T17:34:31-07:00","id":203325,"title":"","content":"Talahan gets down to look directly into the eyes of Eulalia and she can see something cold and merciless in his eyes. As he speaks every word seems to be carefully chosen like he's reading a script. He doesn't seem to be surprised by the fact that the man from the limo is running away.<br /> <br /> &quot; What is going on my dear lady is that this is a delicate situation that Uncle Sam wants resolved quietly. So you are gonna answer my questions with civility and truthfulness or you are gonna go into a hole so dark for so long that you will forget what the sky looks like. Now AM I UNDERSTOOD ? &quot;<br /> <br /> As he gets up he takes a look a closer look at the injured woman in Piero's arms.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-20T17:49:36-07:00","id":203328,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4578431/\" target=\"_blank\">(Composure + Occult = 4 dice)</a><br /> <br /> Eulalia tries to grasp at this &quot;attachment&quot; to the woman's voice, but Talahan's words interrupt, making her forget all about it.<br /> <br /> &quot;Clearly,&quot; she answers him, &quot;What did you want to know?&quot;<br /> <br /> While she gets the feeling that she can't trust this man, he does seem to know what's going on. She'll cooperate, at least for now.<br /> <br /> ((By the way, what time is it roughly? Like is it in the middle of the day, or nighttime? Just wondering))","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2992,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","user":"crapcarp","date":"Whoops, I didn't see Magnsar's post when I originally made mine, so I'm changing it to account for the dialogue)) 07-21-2014, 01:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-21T16:41:35-07:00","id":204346,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">Piero grits his teeth as he struggles to regain consciousness. His eyes, now moving at a sluggish pace, search for a way out of this mess he has gotten himself into. His arms, faring little better, flail about, valiantly trying to free themselves. (Occ: <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4578505/\" target=\"_blank\">The results of my roll are here.</a>)</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":729,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","user":"ocel","date":". 07-23-2014, 06:30 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","name":"ocel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-27T05:45:55-07:00","id":210038,"title":"","content":"&quot;Finally some cooperation ! You see it's not that hard. Now have you notice anything strange or out of the ordinary with this accident ? Strange noises or voices ? suspicious characters? except me of course. Anything at all ? These questions might seems a bit silly but I need all of you to answer them to the best of your abilities.&quot;<br /> <br /> Talahan takes out a note pad and a pen ready to note any details Eulalia might give him.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 07-27-2014, 11:22 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-27T13:12:18-07:00","id":210495,"title":"","content":"&quot;You see that woman over there,&quot; Eulalia asks as she nods her head towards the &quot;woman&quot; and Piero, &quot;She's supposedly been in a car accident and has been losing a lot of blood for at least 10 minutes now.&quot; She had to play this carefully. Certainly many strange things have been going on, but admitting most of them would give a one-way ticket to the nuthouse. She needed evidence to support whatever she brought up. Looking around, she sees one of the police officers staring in horror as he gazes at the translucent blood.<br /> <br /> &quot;Also, as crazy as this may sound, it looks like her blood is translucent. Wouldn't you agree, officer?&quot; She asks the officer, trying to get him to vouch for her.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-28T08:16:34-07:00","id":211239,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Everyone:</b><br /> <br /> By the skin of your teeth, Vincent, you've managed to give the officers the slip. They're now pushing through crowds and searching the side of the road, angrily barking at people to move aside. You've got plenty of room to run if you want, but you'll have to be careful \u2014 the officers are now yelling a description of you back and forth. The crowd is panicked, and could stampede like a herd of cattle at any time. The woman clutching Piero sees this, and digs her nails tighter into Piero's skin; whatever she has planned doesn't work, as Piero's mental defenses are up.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Stay away from me, Talahan!&quot; </i>the woman yells mentally, only heard to Eulalia, Piero and Talahan. Her voice is tinny and reverberating, like she is yelling into an empty soup can. <i>&quot;I haven't violated my parole! We had a deal!&quot;</i></div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-28T11:41:03-07:00","id":211503,"title":"","content":"Vincent looks around for some sort of foliage or something to hide behind. (Wits + Survival w/ 9 again <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4587517/\" target=\"_blank\">6d10.hitsopen(8,9)=2</a>)<br /> <br /> If he finds something he attempts to hide in it, otherwise he continues to try to hide within the crowd. (Dex + Stealth: <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4587519/\" target=\"_blank\">6d10.hitsopen(8,10)=3</a>)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-28T14:56:52-07:00","id":211684,"title":"","content":"&quot;Wait, these two <i>know</i> each other?&quot; Eulalia thinks as her eyes dart between Talahan and the &quot;woman&quot;. Whatever was going on, the situation was clearly spiraling out of control. She had to get out of here, so she looks for a way she drive out.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4587689/\" target=\"_blank\">(Perception = 6 Dice: 3 Successes)</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-29T06:13:46-07:00","id":212380,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><i>Ye Gods! What kind of drugs is this woman on?!</i> Piero musters up what little strength he has left in his feeble body and tries to free himself from the clutches of this fiend. (OCC: <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4588332/\" target=\"_blank\">Here are the results of my roll.</a>)</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":729,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","user":"ocel","date":". 07-30-2014, 04:44 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","name":"ocel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-29T19:27:55-07:00","id":213057,"title":"","content":"Talahan turns is attention towards the woman and puts is notepad back inside is jacket.<br /> <br /> &quot; I'm here because of our deal, your services are required once more. So stop playing and get in the car we don't have the luxury of time on this one. Officers make sure these two don't leave yet and find the other one and arrest him I have questions for him.&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-04T20:09:55-07:00","id":218699,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Everyone:</b><br /> <br /> Nice work, Vince \u2014 you manage to outwit the officers enough that you can safely dive into the bushes. With frustrated shouts, they hurry into the nearby foliage to try and track you, but you are as crafty as a fox. Despite the fact you're relatively well-hidden, you'll still need to find a way to escape, as the cops have swarmed your limo and are planning to have it towed; your driver is nowhere to be seen. The entire road is a mess of smashed cards, angry personnel and oncoming rescue workers, the chaos only making it harder for the cops on the road to concentrate. <b>(Roll Wits+Survival to successfully get away; you have a +1 to your dice pool because you're ahead of the officers)</b><br /> <br /> The woman still has her grip on you, Piero, and she digs her nails deep enough you feel like they're going to break the skin. With a snarl to her echoing thought-voice, she says, <i>&quot;And what if I don't want to? I technically have a hostage here. You don't have your fancy lead cuffs with you. You said the last job was my <b>last </b>job, and then you let me go \u2014 no ifs, ands or buts. You gonna go back on your word and drag civvies into it, too?&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Eulalia, it looks like, with the cops occupied, you can pull out and head to the other lane if you're quick. There's a gap in the crowd, so it'll be hard to hit anyone; now's your chance to make a clean getaway. The woman and Talahan won't be distracted forever. <b>(Roll Dex+Stealth to get to your car, and then Wits+Drive to get away safely; Magnusar gets to roll Perception on both rolls to try and catch you)</b></div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-04T20:45:41-07:00","id":218740,"title":"","content":"Vincent waits for the police to be looking the other way before hustling away. <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4595570/\" target=\"_blank\">7d10.hitsopen(8,9)=2</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-05T00:03:36-07:00","id":218895,"title":"","content":"Seeing her ticket out of here, she jumps at the opportunity, desperate to get out of whatever mess she's in. <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4595613/\" target=\"_blank\">[Dexterity + Stealth + Willpower = 5 dice: 3 Successes]</a><br /> <br /> She then drives off, heading for her patient. <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4595615/\" target=\"_blank\">[Wits + Drive = 4 dice: 1 Success]</a><br /> <br /> The car crash scene fading from view, she does a quick reality check. Why she didn't think to do one before alludes her. <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4595739/\" target=\"_blank\">[Perception = 6 dice: 2 Successes]</a><br /> <br /> ((A reality check is a fundamental technique that all lucid dreamers do to determine whether they're awake or dreaming. There are all sorts of different ways to do this, from plugging your nose to see if you can breathe to looking at a clock twice to see if the time's completely changed. Whatever the method, the essence of the technique isn't so much as the actions in and of themselves, but rather raising awareness in one's perception and memory. The actions are merely tools to make the job easier, the actual job is asking yourself &quot;Am I awake, or am I dreaming?&quot; and focusing on your perception and memory to get the answer.<br /> <br /> Mechanically, a reality check uses the same dice pool as Perception, but it's used to determine whether or not the character is dreaming. Failure results in the character assuming they are awake even when they're dreaming.<br /> <br /> By the way, would she be heading north? Also, what time is it roughly? I know I asked before but I didn't get an answer, so I ask again.))","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-05T01:00:41-07:00","id":218902,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>crapcarp</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/151048-ic-wyoming-in-the-dusk-hunter-mortal-game?p=218895#post218895\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The car crash scene fading from view, she does a quick reality check. Why she didn't think to do one before alludes her. <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4595739/\" target=\"_blank\">[Perception = 6 dice: 2 Successes]</a></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Elude, not allude.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-06T15:38:46-07:00","id":220499,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">&quot;Wait,&quot; he interjects. &quot;You can hear that too?&quot; Turning to Talahan, or as much one can under these circumstances, sounding quite surprised to hear him say this.</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":729,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","user":"ocel","date":". 08-10-2014, 11:22 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","name":"ocel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-14T11:52:11-07:00","id":228280,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\">-{OoC: It's almost afternoon, and you would be heading south, but there's a side route you can take to get back north again. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> }-</div> <br /> <b>Piero:</b><br /> <br /> You never get your answer as Talahan's men step forward. You and the girl are both pried apart, though it feels more like someone is trying to <i>rip your brain from your skull. </i>As the both of you are separated, the woman screeches, kicks and acts like a maniac, leaking what amounts to clear water now; her nails try to gouge deep into the officers. Her voice is reverberating and tinny in your head, and your knees are weak \u2014 you are completely helpless to resist being manhandled. The men know this, and they slap a pair of cuffs on you as you are herded into one cruiser. The woman is herded into another, and it's only when the door slams do you feel the pain in your head stop. <div align=\"right\"><br /> <br /> <b>Eulalia:</b><br /> <br /> You're definitely not dreaming. Everything that just happened is terrifyingly, horrifyingly real, even if it belongs more in some twisted dreamscape. No one is following you or tailing you, thankfully; you are free to continue on to your desperate patient.</div> <div align=\"center\"><br /> <br /> <b><i>~ SCENE CHANGE ~</i></b><br /> </div> <br /> <b>Piero and Talahan:</b><br /> <br /> The pain in your head has faded, but you still feel weak and dizzy. The cruiser with the woman has disappeared, and the Talahan man is sitting in front of you in the passenger's seat. This isn't like any cruiser you've seen before; the inside is outfitted with several small screens, the police cage is made of thicker material, and the doors are armoured from the inside. It looks as much like a moving prison cell as it does a car, but you wouldn't be able to tell from the outside \u2014 the windows are terribly tinted. One might wonder if the level of darkening they have is even legal.<br /> <br /> <div align=\"center\"><b>Vincent:</b><br /> <br /> You're not sure how long you've been wandering but it's fair to say that you're in the middle of nowhere. The forest has given way to open plain, a small waterhole the only break in a sea of sky and grass. The sun now indicates it's almost afternoon (if not afternoon already), and birds chirp merrily in the distance. No one is following you, but there's a coyote drinking from the waterhole. It looks up, and gives you a wary glance before running away.<br /> <br /> </div> <b>Eulalia:</b><br /> <br /> After looping back around off a southbound route, you finally reach your destination. There is a car in the driveway, and chickens cluck around and behind it. A figure waits in a kitchen window, only to flit towards the door as soon as it sees your car. That must be the mother of the trobuled girl.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-14T12:47:34-07:00","id":228371,"title":"","content":"Vincent looks at his watch to see exactly how long it's been (he was watching CNN during the incident, which has a timer ticker). If less than two hours have passed he sets up a small camp (<a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4606872/\" target=\"_blank\">6d10.hitsopen(8,9)=3</a>) to make himself comfortable. If more than two hours has passed he begins to head back towards the road, stealthily (<a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4606875/\" target=\"_blank\">6d10.hitsopen(8,10)=4</a>).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-14T17:00:53-07:00","id":228565,"title":"","content":"Getting out of the car, Eulalia does another reality check. <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4607384/\" target=\"_blank\">[Perception = 6 dice: 1 Success]</a><br /> <br /> While she knows for a fact that she's awake and experiencing reality at the moment, the events from before have shaken her to the point that she's only barely sure. It doesn't help that her sleep schedule was interrupted, so she's a little fatigued as a result. Good news is that she'll have time to sleep after she's had a session with her patient.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hello, I'm Eulalia Bonner, I'm here to see your daughter,&quot; she greets the mother as professionally as she can currently muster, &quot;Sorry I'm late, there was an unusual amount of traffic and a car crash on the road. I hope I haven't made you too worried.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-16T09:01:10-07:00","id":230275,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">He sits there, staring at his handcuffs, thinking, <i>well, isn't this a fine mess you've gotten me into...</i> His eyes, now meeting Talahan's for the first time, slowly adjusts to the lighting. &quot;Is all this really necessary?&quot; He sighs.</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":729,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","user":"ocel","date":". 08-17-2014, 09:54 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","name":"ocel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-21T11:08:07-07:00","id":236705,"title":"","content":"As the men shove piero into the car Talahan gets his cellphone from his jacket and press speed dial it does not take two ring before someone answer<br /> <br /> &quot;This Talahan the ENE has been captured, it opposed some resitance but nothing serious three bystander involved two man and one woman. One man escaped on foot and is considered armed and dangerous and on the run the other one is in custody and the woman departed by car request class 3 manhunt use extreme non lethal force to capture the subjets&quot; he hangs up after getthing an answer and gets in the cruiser.<br /> <br /> (Talahan calls upon is backup in TFV to find Eulalia and Vincent using info from the driver and possible plate number from Eulalia's car)<br /> <br /> Inside the cruiser Talahan observe Piero and goes through his wallet before answering &quot;I'm afraid it is, you have been into contact with a dangerous chemical compound that can affect you brain and state of mind, it should pass in a few hours and it should not leave any after effects but for now I am not taking any chances.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 08-21-2014, 03:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}